# Prettier is configured with endOfLine "lf". Without this file a Windows
# checkout with core.autocrlf=true converts every text file to CRLF, and
# `prettier --check` then fails on the whole tree. GitHub's Windows runners
# set core.autocrlf=true, so the release build cannot pass without it.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.msi binary
*.7z binary
*.zip binary
*.node binary
*.dll binary
